    <string name="masterrom_about_description">MasterROM Opus is a custom firmware for the Samsung Galaxy S20+ (Exynos 990).

It is based on ArtisanROM by Android Artisan, which itself is built on the UN1CA build system by salvogiangri. Almost all of the work comes from their developers and contributors \u2013 MasterROM adds its own changes on top.

It\'s based on the latest iteration of Samsung\'s One UI and includes additional features and tweaks for the best possible experience out of the box.

Bug reports, suggestions and feature requests are welcome.

&#160;</string>

